sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-002: Federated OAuth Registration and Authentication — Provider Linking Sequence
    actor User as Participant
    participant UI as React Application
    participant API as Express /api/auth/oauth/link
    participant Firebase as Firebase Authentication
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    Note over User,UI: Current gap: no React workflow calls this implemented endpoint.
    User->>API: Submit caller Bearer token + provider ID token<br/>(conceptual/API-level flow)
    API->>Firebase: Verify caller token via requireVerifiedParticipant
    Firebase-->>API: Caller identity and auth_time
    API->>DB: Load participant and require is_verified=true
    alt Missing/invalid caller or unverified participant
        API-->>User: 401/403/404, no link
    else Verified PART caller
        API->>API: Reject ADMIN and require auth_time within 15 minutes
        alt Reauthentication stale or role forbidden
            API-->>User: 401 REAUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED or 403
        else Recent primary reauthentication
            Note over API: Current gap: no requireMfa or requireActiveAccount middleware.<br/>A current OTP claim is not checked as AC4 requires.
            API->>Firebase: Verify provider token
            API->>API: Check provider match, verified email, non-ADMIN claim
            API->>API: Require normalized provider email = participant email
            alt Invalid provider, email mismatch, or unverified email
                API-->>User: Explicit 400/401/403/409, no link
            else Valid provider ownership
                API->>DB: Check provider UID and per-participant provider uniqueness
                alt Already linked to this participant
                    API-->>User: 200 idempotent success
                else Linked elsewhere or provider already present
                    API-->>User: 409 conflict
                else No conflict
                    API->>DB: INSERT provider_identities
                    alt Unique race or persistence failure
                        DB--xAPI: Constraint or database error
                        API-->>User: 409 conflict or safe 500
                    else Link persisted
                        API-->>User: 200 provider linked
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over API,DB: The database rejects ADMIN links and enforces identity uniqueness,<br/>but it cannot supply the missing current-MFA and active-account request checks.

